### ===============================
### 1️⃣ SET CONFIG
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/config
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spawnCost": 100,
  "hexPurchaseCost": 1000,
  "initBudget": 10000,
  "initHp": 100,
  "turnBudget": 90,
  "maxBudget": 23456,
  "interestPct": 5,
  "maxTurns": 20,
  "maxSpawns": 5
}

###

### ===============================
### 2️⃣ SET MODE
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/mode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "DUEL"
}

###

### ===============================
### 3️⃣ SELECT CHARACTER P1
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/character
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 1,
  "character": "HUMAN"
}

###

### ===============================
### 4️⃣ SELECT CHARACTER P2
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/character
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playerId": 2,
  "character": "DEMON"
}

###

### ===============================
### 5️⃣ SETUP PLAYER 1
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/setup/full/1
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "type": "FIGHTER",
    "defenseFactor": 1,
    "strategy": "move up; done;"
  }
]

###

### ===============================
### 6️⃣ SETUP PLAYER 2
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/setup/full/2
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "type": "FIGHTER",
    "defenseFactor": 1,
    "strategy": "move down; done;"
  }
]

###

### ===============================
### 7️⃣ CHECK PHASE (SHOULD BE READY_TO_START)
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/phase

###

### ===============================
### 8️⃣ START GAME
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/start

###

### ===============================
### 9️⃣ CHECK PHASE (SHOULD BE PLAYING)
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/phase

###

### ===============================
### 🔟 SPAWN MINION
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/spawn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "FIGHTER",
  "row": 0,
  "col": 0
}

###

### ===============================
### 1️⃣1️⃣ END TURN
### ===============================
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/end-turn

###

### ===============================
### 1️⃣2️⃣ GET CURRENT PLAYER
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/current-player

###

### ===============================
### 1️⃣3️⃣ GET GAME STATE
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/state

###

### ===============================
### 1️⃣4️⃣ GET STATUS
### ===============================
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/status

